From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 19:47:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 16/49] wined3d/opengl32/win32u: Add GL HWND dmabuf bridge

Export GL swapchain contents through the Wayland HWND dmabuf channel when
NO_WINDOW_UPDATE is requested. Add the WGL dmabuf export helpers, channel
producer plumbing, modifier negotiation and slot ownership/reclaim handling.
Provide ARM64EC syscall entry stubs for the new win32u calls as well.
